    <string name="farm_breeding_rules">An adult male and female are required. Time between births, and then time to adulthood: chickens 2 days, sheep 3.5 days, pigs 5 days, cattle 7 days. Each female has one baby per cycle, even while away. Its sex is random. Food, water and shelter are included. Selling the last male stops the cycle. Each pen holds 48 animals.</string>
