    <string name="farm_manure_body">Grown animals fill the pit on their own, even while the app is closed. Every seed you sow takes what it needs from it — as much as its rung on the ladder, so a pumpkin costs twelve and a radish one. A planting on manure grows in rich soil and sells for double, and that doubling stacks with a lucky harvest. Nothing to set: the pit empties itself into the ground.</string>
